<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Self-made test file, CC0 1.0. A piano on two staves with voices numbered the
     way MuseScore does (1-4 for staff 1, 5-8 for staff 2): a chord, a second voice
     that starts late (forward), backup between staves, a meter change with a tempo
     change, and features the model cannot hold yet (grace note, lyric, repeat,
     chord symbol), which must be reported as warnings. -->
